  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6572608ad48474c3f8f098037e362813, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "K\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p: \u0111\u1ED5i h\u01B0\u1EDBng trong U r\u1ED3i
    chuy\u1EC3n xu\u1ED1ng s\xE2n nh\u1EADn; h\xE0nh vi n\u01B0\u1EDBc kh\xF4ng thay
    \u0111\u1ED5i gi\u1EEFa ch\u1EB7ng. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P13 + P05 \u2014 tuy\u1EBFn
    U c\xF3 hai s\xE2n \u1EDF cao \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xE1c nhau, n\u1ED1i b\u1EB1ng \u0111o\u1EA1n
    chuy\u1EC3n m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EE1 \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc.\nRecovery: C\xE1c s\xE2n
    c\xF3 v\xF9ng d\u1EEBng r\u1ED9ng; l\xF9i v\u1EC1 s\xE2n g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t,
    kh\xF4ng t\u1EE5t qua nhi\u1EC1u t\u1EA7ng"
